<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1 Timothi</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timothi</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Timothi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timothi</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Timothi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I hundampa uh Pasian leh ikinepna uh, Mangpa Jesu Khrist thupieh dungzui a, Jesu Khrist sawltah Paul in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ginna a ka tapa dihtah Timothi kungah, Pasian i Pa u’leh i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist akipat hepina, khotuona leh hamuonna, na kungah umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Masidonia gam a ka pei ding kuon a, Kang thuhil bangin, Ephesa khuo ah umden in, mi pawlkhat in thugin dihlou ahil nawnlou na ding ua thu na hil theina dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauten tangthu bulbal neilou khangthu sut beitheilou, kinielna apiengsah ua, ginna zieh a Pasian nasepna lam a phatuomlou thute taisan dingin thu hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam thupiehin atup pen lungtang siengthou leh sie leh pha theina hoi leh ginna dihtah akipat a hing um itna nei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi pawlkhatten tamte a pielsan ua, thuginalou genna lam ah akiheisanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dan hilmite hi akilawp ua, athugen uh umdan leh athuhilte uh adihna atheichien sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh, mi’n dan ahidantaha azahdih nah pouleh dan ahoi chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam khu thei in, dan pen midihtatte dinga bawl ahi sih a, dan bei a gamtate, thumangloute ding, Pasian neiloute leh mikhielte a ding leh misiengloute leh buate, ading, Pate thatte, nute thatte leh mihing thatte a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kingaina lam a thangtatte ading, tokohuate ding, mihing gute a ding, zuou hatte a ding, zuouthu a kihahsielte a ding, tualeh thugin dihtah toh kikal mawngmawngte a dinga bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kung a ngansiena hing kipie, pahtawi taah Pasian thupitah khantanhoi dungzui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh anasempa a ahing koi a, ginum a ahing sim ziehin, ahing suhatpa Khrist Jesu i Mangpa uh kungah kipah thu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tumasang lai in Pasian gensepa, bawlsepa leh huhampa kana hi a, hinanleh theiloupi a ginna neilou a na bawl ka na hi ziehin khotuona ka nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh i Mangpa uh hepina, Khrist Jesu a um ginna leh itna in a dimlet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu Khrist khu mikhielte hundam dingin leitungah ahing pei hi, chi tam thu gintat um leh pomtah mama ahi, tua mi khielte lah ah Kei mikhiel lien pen ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hitamananleh tunuachienga kumtawn hinna tang dinga, Ama hing gingta dingte etsahna dingin, Jesu Khrist in athuohzou dan keima a akilatsah thei na dingin, kei migilou pen hinanleng, tami ziehin khotuona ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuin tangtawn leengpa, shitheilou, mutheilou, Pasian pil umsun kungah zatatna leh thupina kumtawn kumtawn in umta hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tapa Timothi aw, tumasanga nang toh kisai a thumavang kigenlawh thute dungzui in, tam thuhilna ka hing pie hi, tua genlawhna thute zui a kidouna hoi na dou thei na dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ginna leh sielepha theina hoi tudet in, tuakhu mi pawlkhat in apampai ua, ginna lamah kuongsie bangin akehgawp sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaute lah ah Himenaeus leh Alekzandar, atel uhi, Pasian gensietlou azil thei na ding un, amaute Setan kungah ka peta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin amasapenin deingetnate, thungetnate, thungetpiehnate leh kipahthu gennate mi zousie a dinga bawl pieh dingin ka hing hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leengte leh thuneina neite zousie a dingin zong; tuachia Pasian ngaisah leh zatat huoitah a hinkhuo kituoh leh hamuon huoi taha i um theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam khu ihundampa uh Pasian mitmuin ahoiin apomtah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman mi zousie humdam a um ding leh thutah thei dingin a dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian khat a um a, Pasian leh mihing kikaal ah palai khat a um hi, mihing Khrist Jesu khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama pen mi zousie tatdohna man dingin ahing kipie hi, ahuntaha theipi a um dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua theipina thu gen dinga sawltah a guot ka hi; Khrist ah thutah ka gen a, ka zuou sih hi, ginna leh thutah a Jentelte thuhilpa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin pasalten mun chinah khut siengthou jahin, lungthah lou leh ginglel louin thu ngen u’leh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuamabangin numei ten zong, puonsil kilawmhun leh zumthei leh umdan siem in kizem u’henlen, sam suhkiil ahiei, sana ahiei, tuikepsuong ahiei leh, sil mantam a kizem lou in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh numei Pasian ngaisah kichite akilawm hun giapin nasep hoi toh kizem u’leh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numei in sip khinkhian in leh thunuoilutna kim toh zil u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh numei in thu ahil ka phal sih a, ahisihleh pasal tunga thu anei zong ka phal sih hi, sip khinkhian in umzaw u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen Adam siem masah ahi a, tuami nua in Evi siem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Adam sol in a um sih a, hinanleh numei pen sol in a um a, bawsietna ah apuata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahivang in ginna, itna leh siengthouna leh kidehzouna toh hindan kilawm a aum u’leh nau paina ah hundam in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi koipou in hattuom lamkai a pan aut leh na hoi sem ut ahi, chia na kigen khu thudih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n hattuom lamkai pen, gensietbei, zi khat nei, kidehthei, lungsim sieng, umdan hoi, mikiphal, thuhil siem;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zu khamlou, gumtat lou, sum deigawmi hilou, hinanleh nunnem, kihau hatlou, enhatlou;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama innsung vaihawm siem, zatat umtah a atate thunun siem mi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen mi’n ama innsung nangawn vaihawm dan atheisih leh bangchi’n Pasian hattuomte akem thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gingtha mi ahilou ding ahi, tuachilouin akisathei kha ding a, dawimangpa toh kibanga mawpai ahi kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuathamlouin pulam mite pahtat zong ahi ngei ding ahi, tuachilouin minsie in dawimangpa thang ah a awh kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuamabangin hattuom upate khu mizatat um, kamtamlou, zu dawnlou, sum deigawlou ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sie leh pha theina a siengthouin ginna thuguh keem mi ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamte ah etchienin um masa u’henlen, tuazou chienga gensietbei ahi u’leh hattuom upa hina nna sem uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabangmain azite u’zong mi zatat um ahi ngei dinguh ahi, kamtamlou kideh thei, sil zousie a ginum ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hattuom upate khu zi khatnei, atate u’leh a innsung uh kituptah a vaihawm siem mi hi u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen hattuom upa nna hoitaha semten dinmun hoitah leh Khrist Jesu a um ginna lam a hansanna thupitah anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawtlou kaal a na kunga hing pei kinem nanleng tam thuhilnate na kungah ka hing giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hing zekai khah leh Pasian inn sunga bangchi gamtat ding ahiei chi na theina dingin ka hing giel ahi, Pasian innkuonte khu Pasian hing hattuom khuom leh kingahna suongphum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian ngaisahna thuguh khu niel guollou in athupi hi: Pasian tahsain ahing kilanga, Hagau in siem atang a, Vansawlsiengten a mu ua, Jentelte lah ah tangkoupi in aum a, leitung pumpi gintat in aum a, thupina a lahtou in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hun nukhia lam chiengin mi pawlkhatten puimangna hagaute leh dawite thuhilna ngaisahin ginna ataisan ding uh chi Hagau in chientahin agen hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lepchiena a zuouthu genin, asie leh pha theina uh sia am a dep bang ahi ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kiten akham ua, neh ding annte, thutah gingta a theiten, kipahthu gen a saan ding a Pasian in asiemte khu nelou dingin thu apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian silsiem zousie ahoi hi, Kipah thugenna toh saan ahipouleh, bangma nuol ding a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian thu leh thungetna a suhsiengthou ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Unaute kunga tam silte na zilsah leh nang pen thugin thutah leh pilvangtah a na zuisa, thuhilna hoi a khanglien Jesu Khrist nasempa hoi na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian zatatlouna thu leh pitehte tangthu bulbal neiloute dei sinlen, Pasian ngaisahna lam ah kithunun zawin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tahsa lam kithununna in phattuomna themkhat anei a, hinanleh Pasian ngaisahna pen silbangkim ah aphatuom a, tu hun a hinna um leh ahing tung ding hun a hinna ding thuchiem anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam thugen pen a unpia pomtaah leh muonhuoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian hing i muon ziehin, i semgim a, gensietna thuoh in ipang teitei uhi, Ama mi zousie hundampa ahi a, agingtate dingin ahi dieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam thupiehte pie inlen zilsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na naupanna Koima’n simmaw sih heh, hinanleh hamkam suoh ah, gamtat dan ah, itna lam ah, hagau lam ah, ginna lam ah, sienthouna lamah, gingtute etton ding hi zawin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hing pei masangsiein laisiengthou sim, hanthawnna thugen leh thuhilna ngaisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangma a um silpieh thumavang genna a pieh ngaisah lou in um sin, upaten na tunga khut ahing ngap lai ua, na kunga pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam silte ngaituo inlen, mi zousie kunga na phattuom dan kichientah alat theina dingin, tamte ah kizangbeiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma leh na thuhil ah pilvang inlen, tuate ah um ngitnget in, tuabanga na um leh nangma kihumbit in, na thu ngaikhete zong na hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tehsete phawh sinlen, pa bangin hanthawn zawin, tangval deute sanggamte bangin bawlin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pitehte nute bangin, nungah deute sanggamnu bangin sienthouna zousie toh hanthawnin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meithai tahtahte zatat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh meithai koipouin tate leh tute anei leh, anu leh pate uh athuh kiana dingun, amauh innkuon sungah abiehna nasep uh tahsuohna ding zil masa u’heh, tam pen Pasian mitmu in ahoi a, tualeh apomtah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Meithai tahtah ama tanga um in, Pasian amuonga, sun leh zan a ngen in athum ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh meithai ama nopsahna a hing nu khu adamlai in zong ashi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh genbanglou a aum theina dingun tam thute pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh koipou in ama mite adiehin a innkuonpite ading ngaituolou mi khu ginna nuol ahi a, ginglou mi sangin asezaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meithai kum sawmguh nuoi lam, mi khat zi na hita pen meithai a simlou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sil hoi bawl lam a mite pahtat a um a, tate khoilien a, mikhuolte na zintun a, misiengthoute keng na silpieh a, genthei thuohte na panpi a, silhoi chinteng thanuom tah a sem ngitnget ahileh, meithai a sim ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh meithai nungah deute pen gellut sin, aziehpen Khrist lam a ahing kiplou chiengun pasal nei alunggul zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ginna masa uh atawpsan ziehun siemloutangin a um zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaban ah a thasiet chieng un, inn chin ah aban vah kawi ua, athasiet guoh uh hilou in, mi gensiet ahat ua, genlou ding gen in sil teng ah akikum thaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin meithai nungah deuten pasal nei u’henlen, tate nei in innsung kem hoi uhenlen, melmapa a dingin gensietna hunlem bawlpieh sih u’leh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen tuin zong meithai pawlkhatte setan lam ah apielkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gingtu numei ahiei, pasal ahiei, koipou in, inn sunga meithai anei u’leh, panpi uheh, hattuom puohgih guonlou ding ahi, tuachi’n hattuom in meithai tahtahte apanpi thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hattuom upa vaihawm siemte, adieh in thunasemte leh thuhilna nasemte aleni a pahtawina tangtah a guot hi u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen Laisiengthou in “Bawngtal in bu achiil lai in akam kaan sin,” tualeh “Nasem khu law mutaah ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hattuom upa ahehna u’khu, theipimi ni ahiei, thum ahiei apan sih leh pom sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi dangte azau theina dingin, mikhielte pen mizousie mai ah phawhhil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam thuhilnate khentuom neilou a zui ding leh deisah tuom neilou a bawl dingin, Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist leh vansawlsieng telte mitmu in thu ka hing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi koima tungah khut ngap kinaw sinlen, mi dangte khelna ah kikum sin, siengthou tahin kikem ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na gilpi ziehin leh na chinat paipai ziehin, tui guoh dawn nawn sinlen, uoin themkhat khat zang zelin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi pawlkhatte khelnate chientah in akilanga, amaute thukhenna mun atung masa zel uhi; hinanleh mi pawlkhatte pen akhelna un anuazui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuamabangin mi pawlkhatte nasep hoite chientah in akilang a, akilang loute zong akiphuol thei tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasian min leh athuhilna gensiet a aum louna dingin, suoh hahkol a taangte zousie’n ama uh pute khu bangkim a zatat taahin sim u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh gingtu pu a neite’n unaute a hing hitah zieh un, simmaw sih u’heh, hinanleh amauh nasepna phattuompite khu ging tute leh ittahte ahi zieh un, a nna uh seppieh uheh. Tam thute hil inlen hanthawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi koipou in kithuhilna dang ahil a, i Mangpa Jesu Khrist thutah toh kituohlou leh Pasian ngaisahna lam ahil khah sih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama pen akiliensah ahia, bangma theilou ahi; thei malahin kiniel leh kihauna lam ah utna mot huoi anei hi. Tuate a kipat, thangsietna, kihauna, kigensietna leh kiginmawna hoilou,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungsimsie nei a, thutah neilou, mi nielhatna bang ahing pieng zel hi; tuabang mite khu Pasian ngaisahna khu metna a ngai mi ahi uhi; tuabang mite apat in kihemkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh lungkimna toh Pasian ngaisah khu metna thupitah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen leitung ah bangma ipawlut sih a, bangma ipawtpi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Neh ding leh sil ding inei pou leh, tamte toh lungkim ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh hausat lunggulte pen solna leh thang ah leh utna mot huoi leh ahing susethei tampite sungah apualut zel ua, tuaten sietna leh manthaina ah mite atumsah zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen sum ngainat khu sil hoilou chinteng zungpi ahi a, tuakhu pawlkhat in adeigaw ua, ginna akipat apielmang ua, lunggimna tampi in akisun pailet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh nang Pasian mipa aw, tam silte taisan inlen, dihtatna, Pasian ngaisahna, ginna, itna, thuohhatna leh nunnemna del zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ginna kidouna hoi dou inlen, kumtawn hinna khu tudet in, tua khu tang dinga hat zong na hi a, tualeh theipi mi tampi mitmu ah ginna hoi na gumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sil zousie kunga hinna pepa Pasian mitmu leh Pontius Pilat mai a gupna hoi phuongkhepa Khrist Jesu mitmu in, thu kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist hing kilat kia masangsie’n tam thupieh khu nieh banglou leh genbanglou in kem in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam kilahna pen phat taah leh umsun, thuneipa, leengte Leengpa leh mangpate Mangpa Pasian in Ama huntah ah Jesu Khrist ah akilangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama guoh in shi theilouna anei a, koima nai theilou vah ah a um a, Ama koiman amu ngai sih a, mu zong amu thei sih hi; Ama kungah kumtawn pahtawina leh silbawltheina umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu hun a haute kisathei lou ding leh akiplou hausatna a muonna ngalou a, sil zousie i kipahna dinga kichingtaha hing pepa Pasian hing tunga nga zaw dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sil hoi bawl dingin leh nasep hoi a hausa dingin, sil phal dingin, mite pe dinga mansa leh mi dangte kihoppi ut dingin thu pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumtawn hinna atuhdet theina dingun, ahing tung ding hun a ding a, suongphum dettah hi ding, gou kholkhawm dingin amaute hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Timothi aw, na kep dinga hing kipie pen hoitahin kem inlen, Pasian zatat louna a thugen mawh mawhte leh dihloutah a pilna kichi kikalnate pumpel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua theina khu mi pawlkhatten nei akisa ua, ginna lam ah asukhielta uhi. Hepina na kung ah umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
